  {
   "id": "creepy-shift-uncle-joe-s-motel-357060@patch-2026-10-26",
   "gameId": "creepy-shift-uncle-joe-s-motel-357060",
   "displayName": "40% OFF Creepy Shift: Uncle Joe's Motel and New Patch!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-26T14:29:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Creeps! 💀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The scariest time of the year is finally here, and with it comes another Steam Scream Fest!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're also happy to announce that a new patch is now live! It addresses issues reported by the community and introduces further improvements to the game. Thank you for your feedback and for helping us make Creepy Shift better!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changelog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added SMR outline support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the padlock blocker",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed fonts memory allocation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added GC and resources cleaning",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added empty scene preloading",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed multiple camera rendering",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enabled compression on some textures",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added translation to the \"heaven\" cross: And what about us? We're working on the fourth installment! Creepy Shift: Deer Farm is taking shape, getting darker and darker, and soon, it will be ready to haunt you in all its terrifying glory.🐦‍⬛😈: Wishilist now 🛎️: [dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4581030/Creepy_Shift_Deer_Farm/\"]: If you haven't played the demo yet, be sure to give it a try and discover the forest atmosphere waiting for you in the fourth installment of our series. And don't forget to add it to your wishlist! We also invite you to join our Discord 👇 where we're building the next installment together with our community!: Ave, Creeps! May Halloween trap you in its clutches!: Night Shift Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
